'''Chocolate Doge''' (チョコわんこ, ''Choko Wanko'', '''Choco Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] variant of [[Wall Doge]] first encountered in [[A Colossal Valentine's]] during Valentine's Day 2021. It was added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]].

