==Trivia==
*Above the word "dog" on Chocolate Doge's wrapper is the letter "W", which could stand for ''wall'', ''[[Wave Attack|wave]]'', ''woof'', わん ''wan'' (the Japanese onomatopoeia for a dog's bark) or わんこ ''Wanko'' ([[Doge]]'s Japanese name, roughly equivalent to "doggy" or "puppy").
*In [[A Colossal Valentine's/Choco Chaos Lv.1~20|Choco Chaos Lv.14]], Chocolate Doge was accidentally buffed to 3,560% instead of the intended 660%. This was patched in [[Nyanko Daisensou|BCJP]] [[Version 10.3 Update|10.3]]. However, [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] [[Version 10.2 Update|10.2]] had this bugged level for longer than BCJP.
**This was later fixed in the 10.2.1 update.

